{"id":26410,"date":"2025-06-10T06:16:14","date_gmt":"2025-06-10T13:16:14","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.digilens.com\/?p=26410"},"modified":"2025-06-10T06:16:17","modified_gmt":"2025-06-10T13:16:17","slug":"pr-digisaastaq","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.digilens.com\/pr-digisaastaq\/","title":{"rendered":"Manifest Joins DigiSaaS\u2122, Enhancing DigiLens ARGO\u2122 Ecosystem for Frontline Workers"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"26410\" class=\"elementor elementor-26410\" data-elementor-post-type=\"post\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-108251dc e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"108251dc\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f50b4e2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"f50b4e2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"535\" src=\"https:\/\/www.digilens.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/PR_DG_TAQ_SOC-1024x535.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-26428\" alt=\"man in argo smartglasses\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.digilens.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/PR_DG_TAQ_SOC-1024x535.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/www.digilens.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/PR_DG_TAQ_SOC-300x157.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.digilens.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/PR_DG_TAQ_SOC-768x401.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.digilens.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/PR_DG_TAQ_SOC.jpg 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4f048d5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"4f048d5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Manifest Joins DigiSaaS\u2122, Enhancing DigiLens ARGO\u2122 Ecosystem for Frontline Workers<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-06892ce elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"06892ce\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Taqtile\u2019s Manifest is now available on ARGO through DigiSaaS, accelerating digital transformation for frontline and deskless workers across industries<\/h5>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-344ed80 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"344ed80\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-43e63a0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"43e63a0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Sunnyvale, CA \u2013 June 10, 2025:<\/strong> DigiLens Inc., a leading nanotechnology innovator in waveguide display technologies and XR (extended reality) smartglasses, is excited to announce that Taqtile\u2019s Manifest is now a part of the DigiLens DigiSaaS marketplace. This partnership brings powerful AR workflow and training capabilities to organizations deploying <a href=\"https:\/\/www.digilens.com\/argo\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">ARGO<\/a>, enabling the digitalization of frontline and deskless workers.<\/p><p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.digilens.com\/digisaas\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">DigiSaaS<\/a> is the official marketplace for the ARGO platform and future DigiLens products, designed to accelerate the adoption of XR technology by connecting solution partners with DigiLens\u2019 global customer base and channel network. Through DigiSaaS, ARGO customers gain access to a vibrant ecosystem of certified, industry-specific, and ARGO-optimized software solutions, enabling them to maximize their return on investment in AR technology and drive operational transformation within their industry. Certified solutions span multiple industries such as healthcare, manufacturing, field service, and education, enabling use cases such as AI, data visualization, workflow guidance, real-time consultations, and more.<\/p><p>\u201cPairing Manifest with ARGO redefines what&#8217;s possible for frontline teams,\u201d said Dirck Schou, Taqtile Co-Founder and CEO. \u201cTaqtile is excited to be a DigiSaaS member, as many of our customers in the defense, manufacturing, aerospace, and other sectors are already showing strong interest in ARGO as the next-gen AR platform.\u201d<\/p><p>Taqtile Manifest in DigiSaaS delivers an AI-powered, AR-enabled work instruction platform to more frontline workers than ever. Manifest simplifies expert knowledge sharing with step-by-step guidance, annotated photos and videos, AR objects, and built-in remote assistance \u2013 all in one powerful work instruction platform.<\/p><p>Optimized for ARGO, Manifest empowers operators, technicians, and maintainers to complete complex tasks quickly, accurately, and confidently, even in demanding environments. From equipment maintenance in defense and aerospace to procedures in manufacturing and utilities, this collaboration brings a scalable, hands-free solution for frontline teams, right where the work happens.<\/p><p>\u201cWelcoming Taqtile to the DigiSaaS marketplace is a major milestone for DigiLens and the ARGO ecosystem,\u201d said Brian Hamilton, VP of Sales and Marketing at DigiLens. \u201cManifest is a proven platform for delivering immersive, hands-free digital workflows to the frontline, whether on the factory floor or in the field. This partnership brings even more value to our customers by dramatically improving task execution, training, and knowledge transfer through spatially aware, AR-enabled work instructions. We\u2019re excited to see the impact this collaboration will have across industrial and defense sectors.\u201d<\/p><p><strong>Key Benefits for DigiSaaS Partners<\/strong><\/p><ul><li><strong>Global reach:<\/strong> Access to DigiLens\u2019 worldwide salesforce and channel network<\/li><li><strong>Technical enablement:<\/strong> Receive expert guidance to optimize and certify solutions for ARGO<\/li><li><strong>No cost to join<\/strong>: Lowering barriers for emerging solution providers to join and scale<\/li><\/ul><p>By creating this marketplace and partner program, DigiSaaS will enable partners to reach new customer segments and industries that otherwise may be difficult to access, and help XR customers discover innovative XR software solutions, accelerating technology-driven innovation across industries.<\/p><p>Solution providers are invited to join DigiSaaS to unleash their full potential on the ARGO platform and become a part of the future of spatial computing. To learn more, go to <a href=\"https:\/\/www.digilens.com\/digisaas\/\">digilens.com\/digisaas<\/a> or contact <a href=\"mailto:engage@digilens.com\">engage@digilens.com<\/a>.<\/p><p>To experience Manifest on ARGO, schedule a live demo at Augmented World Expo in Long Beach, California, June 10-12, by contacting <a href=\"mailto:sales@taqtile.com\">sales@taqtile.com<\/a>.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d1f94f1 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"d1f94f1\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f5383d8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"f5383d8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">###<\/h5>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3f9e6b9 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"3f9e6b9\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-533cca1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"533cca1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\" eplus-wrapper\"><b>About DigiLens Inc.<br \/><\/b><span style=\"font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit;\">DigiLens is a leader in holographic waveguides used for XR displays. The company has developed a patented optical platform and photopolymer technology that deliver best-in-class solutions using a unique, low-cost contact-copy manufacturing process. DigiLens enables OEM partners to design and build XR-enabled devices for the global automobile, enterprise, consumer, avionics, and defense industries. Based in Sunnyvale, CA, DigiLens\u2019 investors include industry leaders like Samsung Electronics, Samsung Electro-Mechanics, Diamond Edge Ventures, the strategic investment arm of Mitsubishi Chemical Holdings Corporation, Alsop Louie Partners, Optimas Capital Management, 37 Interactive Entertainment, UDC Ventures, the corporate venture arm of Universal Display Corporation, Niantic, Inc., Sony Innovation Fund, Dolby Family Ventures, Continental AG, and more. <\/span>For more information, visit <a href=\"http:\/\/www.digilens.com\">www.digilens.com<\/a><\/p><p class=\" eplus-wrapper\"><em>Press Contact<\/em><br \/>Brian Hamilton<br \/><a href=\"mailto:brian.hamilton@DigiLens.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Brian.Hamilton@DigiLens.com<\/a><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b36c28a e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"b36c28a\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4dfa788 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"4dfa788\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>About Taqtile<br \/><\/strong>Seattle-based Taqtile is revolutionizing how deskless workers do their jobs. Taqtile exists to empower and equip people with the tools they need to complete their jobs flawlessly, accurately, every time.\u202fBy leveraging proven technologies, including spatial computing, augmented reality, AI, 3D visualization, and real-time collaborative communication, Taqtile&#8217;s Manifest platform empowers frontline workers to complete complex tasks more efficiently, completely, and safely than ever before.\u202fFor more information on\u202fTaqtile and\u202fManifest, please visit <a href=\"http:\/\/www.taqtile.com\">www.taqtile.com<\/a><\/p><p><em>Press Contact<br \/><\/em>Chris Hill<br \/>(425) 445-9024<br \/><a href=\"mailto:Chris.Hill@taqtile.com\">Chris.Hill@taqtile.com<\/a><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Taqtile\u2019s Manifest is now available on ARGO through DigiSaaS, accelerating digital transformation for